'''Pokémon Ranger and the Temple of the Sea''' (Japanese: '''ポケモンレンジャーと{{tt|蒼海|うみ}}の{{tt|王子|おうじ}} マナフィ''' ''Pokémon Ranger and the Prince of the Sea: Manaphy'') is a short {{pkmn|manga}} adaptation of the [[M09|movie of the same name]]. It was adapted by 姫野よしかず and published in 小学４年生 ''Year 4 Students'' magazine issues June 2006, July 2006, and August 2006. There is also at least one other manga adaptation of the same movie, [[Pokémon Ranger and the Temple of the Sea (manga)|a long one by Makoto Mizobuchi]].

